mesis Maxime Le Mal y su sofisticada y mal&eacute;vola novia Valentina, lo que obligar&aacute; a la familia a tener que darse a la fuga. Cuarta entrega de 'Gru, mi villano favorito'.";s:7:"runtime";i:0;s:7:"tagline";s:0:"";s:5:"title";s:26:"Gru 4. Mi villano favorito";}}i:6;a:5:{s:10:"iso_3166_1";s:2:"VN";s:9:"iso_639_1";s:2:"vi";s:4:"name";s:22:"Ti&#7871;ng Vi&#7879;t";s:12:"english_name";s:10:"Vietnamese";s:4:"data";a:5:{s:8:"homepage";s:0:"";s:8:"overview";s:1365:"Ti&#7871;p n&#7889;i nh&#7919;ng s&#7921; ki&#7879;n trong ph&#7847;n ba Despicable Me 3 (2017), gi&#7901; &#273;&acirc;y Gru (Steve Carrell l&#7891;ng ti&#7871;ng) &#273;&atilde; ho&agrave;n l&#432;&#417;ng, h&#7841;n ch&#7871; tham gia c&aacute;c ho&#7841;t &#273;&#7897;ng phi ph&aacute;p. Ngo&agrave;i v&#7907; Lucy Wilde v&agrave; c&aacute;c c&ocirc; con g&aacute;i nu&ocirc;i Margo, Edith, Agnes, gi&#7901; &#273;&acirc;y gia &#273;&igrave;nh Gru c&ograve;n &#273;&oacute;n th&ecirc;m th&agrave;nh vi&ecirc;n m&#7899;i l&agrave; nh&oacute;c t&igrave; Gru Junior - con trai &#273;&#7847;u l&ograve;ng c&#7911;a anh. Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, s&#7921; an to&agrave;n c&#7911;a gia &#273;&igrave;nh Gru nhanh ch&oacute;ng b&#7883; &#273;e d&#7885;a khi k&#7867; th&ugrave; c&#361; c&#7911;a anh l&agrave; Maxime Le Mal (Will Ferrell l&#7891;ng ti&#7871;ng) &#273;&atilde; tr&#7889;n kh&#7887;i nh&agrave; t&ugrave;, h&#7855;n l&ecirc;n k&#7871; ho&#7841;ch tr&#7843; th&ugrave; v&agrave; thanh to&aacute;n n&#7907; c&#361; v&#7899;i Gru. &#272;&#7891;ng h&agrave;nh v&#7899;i Maxime c&ograve;n c&oacute; ng&#432;&#7901;i y&ecirc;u Valentina c&#7911;a g&atilde;. Do &#273;&oacute;, Gru bu&#7897;c ph&#7843;i &#273;&#7913;ng l&ecirc;n &#273;&#7889;i m&#7863;t v&#7899;i k&#7867; th&ugrave; &#273;&#7875; b&#7843;o v&#7879; gia &#273;&igrave;nh v&agrave; c&aacute;c Minions.";s:7:"runtime";i:0;s:7:"tagline";s:0:"";s:5:"title";s:42:"K&#7867; Tr&#7897;m M&#7863;t Tr&#259;ng 4";}}i:7;a:5:{s:10:"iso_3166_1";s:2:"GR";s:9:"iso_639_1";s:2:"e